# Sentinel runtime state — baselines, reports, PIDs, and the MCP server log.
# The server log contains every GraphQL query the MCP server issued, which on a
# real catalog means asset names and descriptions. Ignore the directory whole
# rather than enumerating parts of it.
.sentinel/
out/

